🚀 Excited to share my latest AI project!

I’m happy to present my **AI RAG Assistant**, an intelligent web application that allows users to upload PDF documents and ask questions in natural language using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

✨ Features:
• Upload and analyze PDF documents
• Intelligent text chunking
• Semantic search with FAISS
• Sentence Transformers embeddings
• AI-powered question answering using Llama 3.3 (Groq)
• Multi-question support
• Document summarization
• Source references for every answer

🛠️ Tech Stack:
Python • FastAPI • React • Vite • FAISS • Sentence Transformers • Groq API • Hugging Face • Vercel

🌐 Live Demo:
https://ai-rag-assistant-seven.vercel.app

💻 GitHub Repository:
https://github.com/nouraelhoseny13-blip/AI-RAG-Assistant

I'd love to hear your feedback and suggestions!

